<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lilly Industries.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lilly Industries.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Lilly Industries Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said expects Lilly to earn $1.25 a share in 1997 and $1.60 in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Lilly was up 3/8 to 18-3/4.</p>
</text>
